    "body": "fix on issue/2473-tormach-a-without-word · PR #2490 · pinned by a_rapid_with_no_a_word_in_an_indexed_operation_is_refused, a_linear_move_with_no_a_word_in_an_indexed_operation_is_refused, a_stated_turn_to_a0_then_a_move_with_no_a_word_still_posts · merges when reviewed\n\nFacts:\n- The defect reproduces. On the main post script, a rapid or linear record with no A word after an index to A90 posts with no warning.\n- The fix refuses that record by name. It does not keep the section angle. The reason is in `docs/decisions/2473-tormach-a-without-word.md`.\n- Source reading: `post::dump` gives a record with no angle only when the CL move states no axis. No generator was found that emits such a move. No recorded `.cl` shows one.\n",
